# Freeze: a repeat during the Space window passes through before the tap.
0 in key KEY_SPACE down
100 in key KEY_A down
120 in key KEY_A repeat
120 out key KEY_A repeat
200 in key KEY_SPACE up
200 out key KEY_SPACE down
200 out key KEY_SPACE up
200 out key KEY_A down
250 in key KEY_A up
250 out key KEY_A up
